  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Kelpers**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Nealization**: rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n- **In Memory of Elizabeth Reed**: rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Boozer**: rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **Hottentot**: back after 36 archived shows (1943 days); rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **I Don't Need No Doctor**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **We're A Winner**: back after 131 archived shows (3410 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2019-07-13.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 14 songs; 162 min [1]\n- **soulive2019-07-13.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 14 songs; 162 min [2]\n- **soulive2019-07-13.140s.flac16**: source not stated; 14 songs; 159 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Avery Sunshine sang vocals on this song [3]\n- Avery Sunshine also sang vocals on this song [3]\n- The reviewer says the band was playing a hot run across three nights, with exquisite playing [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2019-07-13.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Mics/Room Mics/SBD Matrix [1]. Also: 24-bit matrix of two Schoeps mics (stage-split and FOH booth) plus soundboard feed, all recorded through Sonosax preamps into a Sound Devices 788T [1]\n- **soulive2019-07-13.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Mics/Room Mics/SBD Matrix [2]. Also: Eric McRoberts recorded, edited and mixed the show on 14-15 July 2019, using SoundForge and Vegas Pro, then dithered to 16-bit [2]\n- **soulive2019-07-13.140s.flac16**: taped by Frank D'Auria; transferred by Frank D'Auria; source: Neumann SKM140's > Edirol R44 [3]",
